8-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2c0a77f933fa6045\" href=\"?note=2c0a77f933fa6045\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal.md\">58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\vec C\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\vec C\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\alpha=\\vec C(\\alpha)\">\\(C_\\alpha=\\vec C(\\alpha)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal.md\">58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeSquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeSquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalSquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalSquareSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2c0a77f933fa6045\" href=\"?note=2c0a77f933fa6045\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-comb9-square-thread.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\vec C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\mathcal P(\\kappa^+)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec C)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C_\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists\\xi\\in\\kappa+1\\;\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\xi,C_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(C_\\alpha\\times C_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl((\\beta\\neq0\\land\\sup(C_\\alpha\\cap\\beta)=\\beta)\n\\to C_\\beta=C_\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists D\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,\\vec C,\\kappa^+).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\vec C,\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa^+:\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\},\\mathcal P(\\kappa^+)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec C)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C_\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists\\xi\\in\\kappa+1\\;\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\xi,C_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(C_\\alpha\\times C_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}{}\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl((\\beta\\neq0\\land\\sup(C_\\alpha\\cap\\beta)=\\beta)\n\\to C_\\beta=C_\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists D\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9SquareThread}_S(D,\\vec C,\\kappa^+).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeSquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargeSquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalSquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}square\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalSquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SquareSequence}_S(\\vec C,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coherence is required only at limit points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\alpha\">\\(C_\\alpha\\)</span>, and the final conjunct rules out a club thread.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-large-square-sequence</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-square-sequence</code> are aliases of this canonical predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-club-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exce